{"obsah":"<p>A really tricky event. A bit of confusion in the programme – at the organiser's request we tried to set off half a day earlier – wouldn't have mattered much. If we can, we try to accommodate everyone. But a burst tyre on the car delayed us by almost 4 hours. Luckily we had time in reserve, so in the end the exhibition simply took place at the agreed time in the nice leisure park in Chvalovice, led by Vlasta and Lukáš with the little ones. Katarína Tóthová, thanks to our mobile sound system, took care of a workshop on the nearby pump track.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6023.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6023.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248450\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6024.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6024.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248453\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6025.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6025.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248451\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%